  "sourceTitle": "Honey Taffy",
  "sourceText": "Honey Taffy\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 4, 2009 - 11:28pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup Strained honey\n1 cup Sugar\n1 tablespoon Butter or butter substitute\nFew grains salt\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Boil honey, salt, and sugar to hard ball stage (265 - 270 F). Add butter. 2 Pour into well-buttered pan. Cool. Pull until white and porous. Cut in 1-inch pieces. Hazel Anderson, Meeker, CO.",
  "parsedSource": {
    "ingredients": [
      {
        "sourceText": "1 cup Strained honey"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1 cup Sugar"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1 tablespoon Butter or butter substitute"
      },
