        "sourceText": "Few grains salt"
      }
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "text": "1 Boil honey, salt, and sugar to hard ball stage (265 - 270 F). Add butter. 2 Pour into well-buttered pan. Cool. Pull until white and porous. Cut in 1-inch pieces. Hazel Anderson, Meeker, CO."
      }
